            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PersonaStack 0.2.2

Release date: 2026-09-30

## Fixed

- Finish Setup now becomes available after Accessibility is verified. The permission is labeled (Required).
- Screen Capture, Microphone, Full Disk Access and Local Network are optional for setup. Screen Capture is still needed for screenshot-based control.
- Fixed hidden screen-capture checks blocking Accessibility-only desktop control.
- Fixed optional permission checks interfering with setup completion or disabling working desktop control.

]]></description>
