            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PersonaStack 0.2.1

Release date: 2026-09-30

## Fixed

- Fixed Launch at Login setup skipping registration when macOS had not seen PersonaStack's login item before.
- Replaced the incorrect missing-service and install-in-Applications message with registration recovery guidance.
- Kept pending approval and unconfirmed registration visible until macOS confirms that launch at login is enabled.

]]></description>
